  "description": "Once every hundred years, against impossible odds, someone is born with an extreme yin aura. So Bom is one such person.\n\nRumored that those who possess extreme yin energy can become gods, countless malicious spirits set their sights on Bom after he becomes a college student.\n\nJust then, Geumho, who comes to Bom’s aid, makes a discreet proposal, claiming he can help Bom manage his troublesome constitution…\n\nSo what exactly is Geumho’s true identity?\n\n---\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/bomcomming)",
